{
    "version": "0.4.0",
    "description": "Fast conversion at the terminal: hex2bin, dec2char, lehex2dec, and friends",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/kayfgit/from2to",
    "license": "MIT",
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/kayfgit/from2to/releases/download/v0.4.0/from2to-0.4.0-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip",
            "hash": "0a4315893712f20c6e0dd8d788a747423db90ebefa6a9ac4a4ea30608bc1d3ec",
            "extract_dir": "from2to-0.4.0-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc"
        }
    },
    "bin": "from2to.exe",
    "checkver": {
        "github": "https://github.com/kayfgit/from2to"
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "architecture": {
            "64bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/kayfgit/from2to/releases/download/v$version/from2to-$version-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip",
                "extract_dir": "from2to-$version-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc"
            }
        },
        "hash": {
            "url": "$baseurl/SHA256SUMS"
        }
    },
    "notes": [
        "Scoop installed one command, `from2to`.",
        "The per-conversion commands (hex2bin, lehex2dec, ...) are a second step,",
        "and they must go somewhere already on PATH. Scoop's shim directory is:",
        "",
        "    from2to install --dir \"$env:USERPROFILE\\scoop\\shims\"",
        "",
        "Scoop does not know about those files, so `scoop uninstall from2to` will",
        "leave them behind. Run `from2to uninstall` first if you are removing it."
    ]
}
